    {
      "type": "FUNCTION",
      "name": "bullet3d.shape.get_shape",
      "brief": "Get shape geometry data.",
      "description": "The returned table always contains <code>type</code>, one of <code>bullet3d.shape.SHAPE_TYPE_*</code>.\nA sphere also contains numeric <code>diameter</code>; a box contains vector3\n<code>dimensions</code>; a capsule contains numeric <code>diameter</code> and cylindrical-section\n<code>height</code>; a hull contains a <code>vertices</code> array of vector3 values; and a triangle\nmesh contains only <code>type</code>. Primitive and hull tables use Defold units and can\nbe passed to a <code>bullet3d.world</code> shape query after adding the desired <code>position</code>\nand optional <code>rotation</code> fields.",
      "returnvalues": [
        {
          "name": "data",
          "doc": "typed shape geometry in Defold units",
          "types": ["bullet3d.shape.definition"]
        }
      ],
      "parameters": [
        {
          "name": "shape",
          "doc": "shape handle",
          "types": ["btCollisionShape"],
          "is_optional": "False"
        }
      ],
      "examples": "",
      "replaces": "",
      "error": "",
      "tparams": [],
      "members": [],
      "notes": [],
      "language": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "FUNCTION",
      "name": "bullet3d.shape.set_shape",
      "brief": "Set shape geometry data.",
      "description": "The table uses the same format as <code>get_shape</code>. Its <code>type</code> must match the\nexisting shape because changing native shape type is not supported. Primitive\ndimensions must be finite and greater than zero. Hulls require at least four\nfinite vertices. Triangle mesh geometry cannot be changed with this function.",
      "returnvalues": [],
      "parameters": [
        {
          "name": "shape",
          "doc": "shape handle",
          "types": ["btCollisionShape"],
          "is_optional": "False"
        },
        {
          "name": "data",
          "doc": "typed shape geometry in Defold units",
          "types": ["bullet3d.shape.definition"],
          "is_optional": "False"
        }
      ],
      "examples": "Increase the dimensions of the first box shape by 50 percent for this instance:\n<div class=\"codehilite\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kr\">function</span> <span class=\"nf\">init</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">self</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"kd\">local</span> <span class=\"n\">object</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">bullet3d</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">get_collision_object</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;#collisionobject&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"kd\">local</span> <span class=\"n\">shape</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">bullet3d</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">collision_object</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">get_shape</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">object</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"kd\">local</span> <span class=\"n\">data</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">bullet3d</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">shape</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">get_shape</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">shape</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n    <span class=\"kr\">if</span> <span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">type</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"n\">bullet3d</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">shape</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">SHAPE_TYPE_BOX</span> <span class=\"kr\">then</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">dimensions</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">dimensions</span> <span class=\"o\">*</span> <span class=\"mf\">1.5</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">bullet3d</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">shape</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">set_shape</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">shape</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"kr\">end</span>\n<span class=\"kr\">end</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
      "replaces": "",
      "error": "",
      "tparams": [],
      "members": [],
      "notes": [],
      "language": ""
